flowchart LR
  J1[9-36V IN] --> F1[F1 5A]
  F1 --> RP[Reverse-polarity stage]
  RP --> DC[MEAN WELL RSDW60F-12]
  DC --> V12[12V / 5A]
  V12 --> JETSON[Jetson Orin Nano DC jack]
  JETSON -->|USB3 + 5V| CAM[See3CAM_50CUGM]
  V12 --> B33[3.3V synchronous buck]
  B33 --> STM[STM32H743]
  B33 --> S1[IIS3DWB 1]
  B33 --> S2[IIS3DWB 2]
  B33 --> S3[IIS3DWB 3]
  B33 --> GPS[ZED-F9P]
  B33 --> ENV[SHT41 temp/RH]
  S1 -->|SPI + INT| STM
  S2 -->|SPI + INT| STM
  S3 -->|SPI + INT| STM
  GPS -->|UART + PPS| STM
  ENV -->|I2C1| STM
  STM -->|USB CDC| JETSON
